{"id":"3a0c7a9eeacf6544","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Payoff Reduction","display":"df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction — ZFC Game2 Payoff Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction — ZFC Game2 Payoff Reduction","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-payoff-reduction — ZFC Game2 Payoff Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,P,Q,A,B\\in V\">\\(f,P,Q,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PayoffReduction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PayoffReduction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PayoffReduction}_S(f,P,Q,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nP\\subseteq\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\}\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\{y\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times B):\\mathrm{Function}(y,\\omega,B)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(f,\n\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\},\n\\{y\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times B):\\mathrm{Function}(y,\\omega,B)\\}\\right)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times A)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\to\n(x\\in P\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in Q)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PayoffReduction}_S(f,P,Q,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nP\\subseteq\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\}\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\{y\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times B):\\mathrm{Function}(y,\\omega,B)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(f,\n\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\},\n\\{y\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times B):\\mathrm{Function}(y,\\omega,B)\\}\\right)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times A)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\to\n(x\\in P\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in Q)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text"